WEBVTT

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:13.850
Eruru-sama...

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:26.110
It's trembling...

00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.200
I beg of you, Eruru-sama!  Please grant us your strength!

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:38.770
Um...  Who might you two be?

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:44.140
Eruru-sama, please help save our lady!

00:01:47.550 --> 00:01:51.010
Um, I still don't quite get it...

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:56.920
We won't hurt you!  Just come with us for now.

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:56.920
No!  Wait!

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:33.100
The days pile ever onward, hiding the radiance within

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:43.830
Believing in the inevitable, inside the cradle of magma

00:02:56.970 --> 00:03:03.480
Where are you battling?  What have you earned?

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:09.980
Here by your side, I gaze at you in silence

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:17.830
Longing, waiting, strengthening in wholehearted perseverance

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:26.250
Yearning, I am led astray, yet my feelings can't express

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:35.140
Even if the road ahead has been decided by others

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:42.730
Only for your sake, I will go on without resistance

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:50.040
The days pile ever onward, hiding the radiance within

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:59.340
Believing in the inevitable, born in profound darkness

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:08.240
Inside the cradle of magma

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:21.960
<b>Vol 2. Prescription for a Secret Love</b>

00:04:26.730 --> 00:04:28.070
Nopon?

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:30.640
Gomuta?

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:36.190
They're not here?

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:39.690
Ow...

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:48.410
Explain yourselves.  Why did you bring me here?

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:55.120
Well, actually...  We were hoping you'd make a medicine for us, so...

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:58.750
...A medicine?

00:05:00.390 --> 00:05:02.050
I've never seen this medicine before.

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:07.920
The thing is, our lady has fallen in love with someone...

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:08.520
In love?

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:11.470
But, what does that have to do with medicine...?

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:17.040
Well, there's a deep reason behind it...

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:23.410
That person is well...  Uh...

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:29.540
He is only interested in very young women...

00:05:30.840 --> 00:05:32.580
So you guys were here.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:38.040
Nopon, Gomuta, did you get all the materials for today?

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:43.050
We're working hard on it...

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.050
Who's that?

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:48.620
I'm Eruru, a medicine girl.

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:55.350
Eruru-sama?!

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:58.870
What have you two done?!

00:06:00.740 --> 00:06:06.500
I never asked you for this!  Don't go acting on your own!

00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:10.030
U-um...

00:06:10.030 --> 00:06:13.990
My apologies.  I'll make them take you back to the castle right away.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:16.260
So don't worry.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:21.420
Would you listen to us?!

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:23.990
Sure!

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:30.560
It's quite a tear-jerking tragedy.

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:39.810
And for the orphans who lost everything in the war...

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:45.600
Yes!  Our lady chose to sacrifice her happiness as a woman...

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:50.990
Hold it!  Don't just spew out half of my life so frivolously!

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:58.780
We only hope you'd be allowed the happiness you rightfully deserve...

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:02.000
I understand your situation now!

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:05.960
Please allow me to assist you to my fullest extent!

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:08.670
W-wait, don't just...

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.380
Eruru-sama...

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:14.300
Thank you so much!  Thank you so much!

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:14.300
Listen to me!

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:16.900
So, what kind of illness is it?

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:18.430
Well...

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:20.740
Nevermind about that.

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:25.350
Kamuchataru-san!  I'm talking with Nopon-san right now!

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:41.590
Good morning, sire.

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:45.900
Breakfast will be served soon.

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:47.380
Oh, well then.

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:50.840
I am not summoning you to come eat.  It will be brought here very soon.

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:53.300
Nah, I think I'll take a break.

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:55.760
Do not worry yourself. Please continue.

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:57.720
Well then.

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:01.190
Benawi, wait...

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:09.440
Benawi-niisama!

00:08:09.440 --> 00:08:10.360
What's the matter?

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:13.320
Eruru-sama is gone.

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:25.350
Her age is so close to mine...

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:29.300
Yet to take something like medicine of rejuvenation... How wasteful.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:35.760
Written on here is the medicine made just for our lady's illness.

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:43.350
I don't know the details, but...

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:47.810
All we know is that it will return its users to their youth.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:51.310
Probably...

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:51.310
How much younger?!

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:55.780
I...  I have no need for such a medicine...

00:08:56.650 --> 00:09:01.140
Now, send Eruru-sama back already.

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:04.510
Um...  I have something I'd like to ask...

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:11.210
You don't have to answer, but...  Who is the person you...?

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:16.740
I can't say it too loudly...

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:21.600
But he's actually someone you know very well.

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:29.270
He has braved countless battles riding upon his uoputaru.

00:09:32.930 --> 00:09:38.240
His sword skills are outstanding, and his tactics are equally profound!

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:47.370
He's the one that commands the mighty Tousukuru cavalry!

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:49.080
Cavalry?

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:52.840
Thank goodness.

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:55.570
That person's name is...

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:58.680
Enough already!

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:21.540
This is...

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:33.520
Open the gate!

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:35.450
Open the gate!!

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:40.840
I've completed the border inspections.

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:42.880
It's been ten days.

00:10:44.440 --> 00:10:46.090
Is the smell bad?

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:49.810
We've been camping outside recently...

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.770
No, well done.

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:56.250
I'd like for you to take a good rest...  However...

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:57.780
Did something happen?

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:01.990
Sire, I have report.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:05.960
What?  Eruru?

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:09.410
Sire, please allow me to handle this matter.

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:11.450
Have you got any leads?

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:20.170
Alright, I'll leave it to you.

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:21.180
Understood.

00:11:26.300 --> 00:11:27.890
Please take care of these.

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:37.400
Benawi-san had such tastes...

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:38.940
Ah~

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:38.940
Bump!

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:40.860
Owie~

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:40.860
I'm so
sorry...

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:40.480
Oh my...

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:42.820
Oh, stop it~

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:42.820
You're so
beautiful.

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:42.820
Please go out 
with me.

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:43.240
Glad to make your acquaintance.

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:44.780
Just
Married

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:44.780
Ha
Ha
Ha
Ha
Ha

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:44.780
Leave everything to me.

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:48.470
What are you doing?

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:52.780
I'll get in trouble if you don't go back...

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:55.720
Good timing.  Can you help me stir this?

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:58.090
It'll harden if it sits for too long.

00:11:58.090 --> 00:11:59.970
What's this about?

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:04.010
The medicine of rejuvenation, of course.  You can count on me.

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:06.820
This is it?

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:07.860
Yep!

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:11.440
The medicine of rejuvenation...

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:13.440
Enough!

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:17.540
But your feelings for him are real, aren't they?

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:21.360
Please don't lie to your own feelings.

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:27.080
What a nosy gal.  This has nothing to do with you.

00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:29.040
That's not true!

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:31.500
Granny often said...

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:34.460
Those who can heal the body are only second rate.

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:38.210
A true medicine-man can heal the heart.

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:42.420
Kamuchataru-san, as a medicine girl, and as a woman,

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:45.810
I want to help make your love come true.

00:12:46.770 --> 00:12:48.290
Geez...

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:53.390
I'm grateful for your thoughts, but I still have to refuse.

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:59.230
I have certain unyielding reasons.

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:06.820
If I accept your help, I'll never be able to live with my head held high.

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:09.520
Kamuchataru-san...

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:11.530
If you get it, hurry up and...

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:15.790
Say, where did Nopon and Gomuta go?

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:18.750
Those two are...

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:21.600
On a chore for me in the castle...

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:34.180
Gomuta, we've got everything Eruru-sama asked for, right?

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:36.350
Then off we go!

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:41.180
Did they just come out of Aru-chan's room?

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:42.580
Kimamau-san?

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:43.870
Who?

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:58.480
L-listen...  Let's act like we aren't suspicious at all.

00:14:00.370 --> 00:14:02.630
They aren't suspicious, they said.

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:05.470
They're totally suspicious though.

00:14:08.220 --> 00:14:10.260
I can understand you!

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:15.000
Wow!  Wow!  What's your name?

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:18.560
Gomuta?  Gomuta?

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:22.250
Gomuta!

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:22.250
Aru-chan...

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:24.980
They don't seem to be bad people.

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:29.540
That's right!

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:34.950
Eruru-sama asked us to come pick up some tools for her!

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:37.410
For Eruru-neesama?

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:43.670
Yeah!  We're in a rush, so Gomuta, let's go!

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:48.570
One...  Two...  Three...

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.390
What are you doing?!

00:14:49.310 --> 00:14:51.640
One...  Two...

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:55.340
We're gonna get yelled at again if we don't hurry up!

00:14:56.400 --> 00:14:58.430
They left...

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:00.100
Who were those two?

00:15:00.760 --> 00:15:03.530
Alright, time to get back.

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:21.290
So.

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:24.750
Why did you kidnap another one?

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.720
Ah well, please relax.

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:32.330
Just who is telling you to do all this?!

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:34.200
But, my lady...

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.490
Be quiet!

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:42.390
Don't forget, we've betrayed this country once before.

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:45.900
Normally, our heads would have been chopped off.

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:50.740
But that person pardoned us out of compassion.

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:56.320
We can't betray his trust once again.

00:15:56.320 --> 00:15:59.320
Take those two back right away.

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:01.560
While it's not too late.

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:09.850
Take out the medicines written here.  Also, boil lots of water.

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:14.770
Come on already.  You really need to go back.

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:18.680
Don't speak to me.  This part is very critical.

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:21.390
What?

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:26.580
No bugging sis when she's making medicine!

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:27.820
...Auntie.

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:31.750
Who are you calling an "auntie"?!

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:35.680
Now now, my lady, it's just the words of a child.

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:40.080
So to a child, I'm very much an old woman then?!

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:42.540
I didn't mean that!

00:16:45.110 --> 00:16:46.180
Yeah?

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:50.830
We're nearly out of ingredients, and you're busy too...

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:53.760
If only there's someone who knew where to get them.

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:57.090
What is it?

00:16:57.980 --> 00:17:00.990
Gomuta says he'll bring it!

00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:10.640
I feel so alive.

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:15.400
But, who'd have thought Eruru-neesan would suddenly disappear...

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:21.950
Well, since it's her, I guess there's no need to worry.

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:27.330
Kuro-niisama!

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:28.460
Back from a bath?

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:30.840
Yo, ladies.

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:34.920
The little one isn't with you guys?

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:37.720
Ah, you haven't heard?

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:42.140
Aru-chan has disappeared too.

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:44.100
What?!

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:57.480
You're sure the little one was with a kimamau?

00:17:57.480 --> 00:18:01.760
Yes, it definitely smelled like a kimamau.

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:08.470
Open the gate!

00:18:08.470 --> 00:18:09.120
Kuro.

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.320
You know, don't you?

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:13.590
Captain...

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:17.050
That person isn't someone who'd make the same mistake twice.

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:20.800
But, in the unlikely event...

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:21.960
Got it...

00:18:30.260 --> 00:18:31.690
What's all the ruckus?

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:34.400
Gomuta!  Who did it?

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.360
I'll show myself in.

00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:43.290
K-Kuro!  Why are you...

00:18:43.320 --> 00:18:49.590
Tired from walking, I've come to a stop

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:47.970
If I knew you were coming, I'd have fixed up a little...

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:51.750
Why?  That's what I want to ask you.

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:57.780
Where was I about to go?

00:18:52.250 --> 00:18:57.210
Quit pretending!  I know those two were kidnapped here!

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:59.460
W-well...

00:18:58.440 --> 00:19:04.710
Right in front of my eyes, a road opens wide

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:03.800
Kuro-san, could you withdraw from here?

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:05.270
I knew it...

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:07.220
Damn you, Nopon!

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:12.070
Leading to somewhere unknown

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:13.690
We can't afford to lose, for our lady's sake!

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:19.820
While I still don't know, should I start to walk?

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:16.150
Wait, guys!  Stop!

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:29.450
I've begun walking, yet knowing nothing still

00:19:25.530 --> 00:19:26.990
Out of my way!

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:37.050
While the rain beats down on me, while the wind blows against me

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:35.250
Damn you!

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:44.420
It crosses my heart

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:52.510
Through a rift in the clouds, radiance blooms, a light starts to shine

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:53.730
What now?

00:19:52.810 --> 00:20:00.100
I will walk on this journey of just mine

00:20:03.610 --> 00:20:04.820
It's not over!

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:14.790
You'll never defeat geniuses like us!

00:20:29.690 --> 00:20:30.930
That's enough!

00:20:34.930 --> 00:20:37.620
I'm sorry, Kuro.

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:40.570
I did it all by myself.

00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:46.990
Come on, Kuro.  This is the second time.

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:49.530
Do it already.

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:58.380
It's not your fault this time, princess.

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:02.030
Kuro...

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:24.550
Thank you.

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:29.540
It's done!

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:31.360
It's done!

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:32.290
Done!

00:21:32.870 --> 00:21:34.750
You guys are safe!

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:37.960
The medicine is done!

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:39.920
Really!?

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:41.520
Yes!

00:21:41.520 --> 00:21:42.420
With this-

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:49.290
Huh?

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:08.030
What the hell happened to this guy...

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:14.490
A-are you alright?!

00:22:14.490 --> 00:22:16.600
Auntie, wake up.

00:22:17.520 --> 00:22:20.920
What's going on here...?

00:22:20.920 --> 00:22:23.600
Aren't I pretty?

00:22:25.140 --> 00:22:30.700
Our secret prescription passed down through the generations is...

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:42.900
They did it for their mistress, huh?

00:22:44.120 --> 00:22:47.870
If that's so, I guess we can't really punish them.

00:22:48.730 --> 00:22:50.100
Just let this one pass.

00:22:50.100 --> 00:22:50.960
Roger.

00:22:52.040 --> 00:22:56.830
But, what loyal followers she has.  I'm rather jealous of her...

00:22:57.420 --> 00:22:58.290
Indeed.

00:22:58.290 --> 00:23:04.460
But Benawi, why didn't you report anything to me during the investigation?

00:23:05.070 --> 00:23:06.480
Because...

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:09.770
You too, are a loyal follower, huh?

00:23:17.100 --> 00:23:21.810
Sorry for messing up your store, princess.

00:23:21.810 --> 00:23:26.900
It's fine, just pay me for the damages properly.

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:31.670
I feel truly sorry about this.  If there's anything I can do, just lemme know.

00:23:31.670 --> 00:23:34.200
W-what?!  A-anything?!

00:23:35.330 --> 00:23:37.130
Just say the word!

00:23:37.130 --> 00:23:40.210
T-then...  Um...

00:23:41.250 --> 00:23:42.660
What?

00:23:47.110 --> 00:23:51.400
I can't say!

00:23:56.230 --> 00:24:04.900
I once drew from imagination, a dream that never fades

00:24:05.140 --> 00:24:16.400
Now living the future desired, though not without shedding childish ways

00:24:22.510 --> 00:24:30.520
Locked up in my heart, completely forgotten

00:24:30.750 --> 00:24:39.690
That dream I sketched endlessly once upon a time

00:24:40.020 --> 00:24:54.780
Regretting, lamenting, yet I cannot get it back

00:24:55.710 --> 00:25:04.320
Let's soar high up into the sky, free like the birds

00:25:04.540 --> 00:25:12.630
Spread our wings wide, as if embracing the whole world

00:25:12.800 --> 00:25:21.310
This wind caressing our cheeks, although a bit cold to the touch

00:25:21.520 --> 00:25:34.440
Has quietly become pleasant in this unexplainable anxiety

00:25:59.380 --> 00:26:01.160
Are you alright?

00:26:01.160 --> 00:26:01.760
Yep.

00:26:01.760 --> 00:26:03.340
I see.

00:26:12.720 --> 00:26:14.030
Sis!

00:26:19.560 --> 00:26:22.740
Aruru...  Sit down here.

00:26:23.980 --> 00:26:24.950
Yeah?

00:26:26.980 --> 00:26:28.920
Answer a question for me.

00:26:31.480 --> 00:26:35.340
What do you think of Benawi-san...?

00:26:37.690 --> 00:26:40.670
You might be too young for this, but...

00:26:40.670 --> 00:26:48.270
If Benawi-san says that kind of thing to you, come talk to me about it, alright?!
